{"about_the_game":"In \u300aPromotion Simulator\u300b, you will play a common person without a background who steps into the officialdom step by step. Simply click, wave, and swipe your finger to handle various demands from your colleagues, superiors, and people. With your strong decision-making power and intelligence, you will wander through the officialdom and ascend to a higher position. Every decision you make may have a corresponding impact, and if you take the wrong step, you may fall into an abyss of irreparable harm. Whether they are good or bad, please choose carefully.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745980/extras/b7a0654d19de380086de5095d700e0db.avif?t=1688473621\" width=706 height=404 /></span><br><br>Promotion to a higher official position: With your strong decision-making power and intelligence, you can wander through the officialdom, advance to a higher official position, and then share it with your friends.<br><br>Prudent decision-making: Every choice you make will have an impact on four dimensions: political performance, wealth, interpersonal relationships, and public opinion. Once one of these options loses control, you will suffer catastrophic consequences.<br><br>Rich and diverse achievements: Unlock various rare and little-known achievements and share them with your friends.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u521d\u5165\u5b98\u573a","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1745980/56f29aaef8a0b90c9df5bc5718a7a49d28a04a7c.jpg"},{"name":"\u5b98\u573a\u8001\u6cb9\u6761","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1745980/6b40d65d9800efb00fe345d792d619acf4a9a82f.jpg"},{"name":"\u5b98\u573a\u626b\u5730\u50e7","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1745980/8d3b4ab92620965d20b3a884d474a7b632f6d76e.jpg"},{"name":"\u9152\u56ca\u996d\u888b","path